<title>USA: Fundraiser for Basile children for Monday night.</title>
<headline>Fundraiser for Basile children for Monday night.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A fundraiser will be held Monday evening for the children of Joseph Basile, a former municipal bond professional with J.F. Hartfield &amp; Co, who died in January after a long illiness.</p>
<p>The education fundraiser will be held at Tristino's, 97th Street and Third Avenue in Bayridge, Brooklyn, N.Y., from 7:00 p.m. to 10:00 p.m.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
